## Legacy appendix: Tailwind v3 and Next 14 to 15

If a project is still on Tailwind v3, the theme lives in `tailwind.config.ts` under `theme.extend`, not in an `@theme` block. Container query support requires the `@tailwindcss/container-queries` plugin rather than being built in. On Next 14 to 15, the image LCP control is the `priority` prop rather than the `loading` and `fetchPriority` pair. Everything else in this document applies unchanged. Do not mix v3 config and v4 `@theme` in one project.

---

## What to never do on mobile

- No horizontal scroll at 360px.
- No font size below 16px on inputs.
- No `100vh` for full height sections. Use `dvh`.
- No touch target under 44px.
- No sidebar drawer nav. Full screen overlay only.
- No lazy loaded LCP image.
- No placeholder used as the only label.
- No desktop hover effect that has no tap equivalent on a touch device.
- No redesign. This is an adaptation of an approved desktop design.
